            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "wilmany64"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious!! I made this today and after reading some of the reviews, I did used the 1/2 white/brown sugar ratio. It came out so good. I also cooked for and extra 15 minutes and peeled my apples. My husband is very, very happy!! Thank you!",
            "datePublished": "2014-10-08T13:50:18.870Z"
          },
          {
