            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Gail"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I've made it many times and always like the flavor and ease in putting together. I have two in the oven right now, but they will probably not be as good as all I had was gala apples. Really should use green cooking apples. Don't slice the apples too thin (too late), as it will be mushy. Because of the gala, I cut the temp and baking time down some. Love this website! Gail",
            "datePublished": "2015-11-25T19:44:45.340Z"
          },
